('sardine-linguine', 'Sardine Linguine', '🐟', 'Linguine with tinned sardines, onion, chilli, capers and pine nuts, served with a shaved fennel and parsley salad. Serves 2, about 20 minutes. Source: Sardine linguine – Jamie Oliver (from Jamie''s 20-Minute Meals)', 2, 20, 'Sardine linguine – Jamie Oliver (from Jamie''s 20-Minute Meals)', 'https://www.jamieoliver.com/recipes/pasta/sardine-linguine/', 'Easy to double for 4 portions.
